      "revision": 1373487297,
      "text": "Ficus nervosa is a tree in the family Moraceae which grows up to a height of 35 metres. It is native to tropical Asia, southern China, and Taiwan, where it grows in lowland tropical moist forests. The tree is grown in coffee plantations for shade."
    },
    "es": {
